ory_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","review_id":"NvK8O4tGMO8XKFPOewHN-Q","date":"2014-07-27T05:24:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9445787072181702,"text_excerpt":"Came here for the lunch buffet this Friday. It came out to be $15 with the government employee discount. It was a good deal. The buffet was totally worth it. They even have a section that'll cook you a hanger steak to order. They have a good selection of food items and it was good quality. Even the dessert was good. I would come back here every Friday for lunch."},{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","review_id":"JmE5Cok--7SzCuXkgDAS6g","date":"2011-10-31T23:56:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402976036071777,"text_excerpt":"I went here for the Breakfast/Lunch buffet the past 2 weekends and have to say it was pretty good. The buffet prices are $17 for Breakfast and $14 for Lunch, which is weird for me coming from Vegas. The types of food offered and the quality is very high given the reasonable pricing. 8 Block wins hands down compared to what they offer at the buffet in the Crystal Room at Le Pavillon, the price is better and the food is better. Some of the fancier/unique things offered at 8 Block: - Lox & Bagels (all the trimmings) - Cured meats & cheese (Prosciutto, Salami, sheep milk, gouda, bleu, trimmings) - Omelette station - Multiple fruit bowls (berries) - A large variety of desserts I think drinks (..."},{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","review_id":"yjpKm6z6L_3nz1DsbSR8wA","date":"2015-04-21T18:11:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9237293004989624,"text_excerpt":"Buffet of ALL THE THINGS! The whole buffet was amazing. They will make any kind of omelette you'd like and had fun things like boudain, shrimp, and alligator sausage. It gets packed and they didn't have enough staff, so that's why I can't give it 5 stars. The cost was good considering the amount of offerings. Having it at the hotel where we stayed was also nice as we came down and there it was! I'd completely go back just for the buffet!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","photo_id":"jS3n2JCLAGWvfiXCaUQDkQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jS3n2JCLAGWvfiXCaUQDkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8947563171386719},{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","photo_id":"DWMZZIwbfudC6y36N1qnDQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DWMZZIwbfudC6y36N1qnDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7772180438041687},{"business_id":"kScdTf3kazTb5uBJfaOlMw","photo_id":"CUgb1SN8UwuePa74U4dZUw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CUgb1SN8UwuePa74U4dZUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6515482068061829}]},"notebook_case":null}
